SELECT w.id, (SELECT ws.id FROM worksheet_sections ws WHERE ws.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND ws.code = 'D'), 'kg_380_from_rows', 'Σ Kostenpositionen KG 380 Structural fixtures (aus dem Register)', 'number', 'EUR', false, '§5.4 Table 1 (KG 380)', 'Plan 3: Ausgabe der Gleichung DIN-276-11-D12 (sum_rows über kg3_positionen.kosten_eur mit ebene2 == ''KG 380'' — Positionen der KG 380 und ihrer Untergruppen; 0 ohne Zeilen); Zwilling zu kg_380_total (din276-D-3).', 'imported_unverified', '\hline 380 & Structural fixtures & \begin{tabular}{l}
Installations permanently connected to the building, but without the utilisation-specific installations (see KG 470) \\
The decisive factor for the demarcation from KG 600 is that the fixtures require technical and planning measures due to their nature and type of installation (e.g. preparation of execution drawings, static and other calculations, connection of installations).
