SELECT w.id, (SELECT ws.id FROM worksheet_sections ws WHERE ws.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND ws.code = 'C'), 'kostenstufen_matrix', 'Kostenermittlungsstufen × Kostengruppen (je Stufe KG 100–800, Σ, Bauwerkskosten, Eigenleistungen / Prognose / Risiko)', 'json', NULL, false, '§4.3.2–4.3.7, §3.11, §3.12, §4.4.2', 'Plan 3: eine Zeile je Kostenermittlungsstufe (Kostenrahmen … Kostenfeststellung) mit den acht KG-Summen; Σ je Stufe → KR_gesamt_calc … KF_gesamt_calc (DIN-276-18-D1 … D5), aktuelle / vorherige Stufe → stufe_aktuell_gesamt / stufe_vorher_gesamt (-D7 / -D8), Abweichung → stufen_abweichung / _pct (-D9 / -D10). Die fünf Stufen-Arbeitsblätter DIN-276-18 … -22 (≈ 90 getippte Werte) und die Eingaben current_stage_total / previous_stage_total (-26) sind Ablösekandidaten (din276-D-1 / D-2 / X-2; Konsumenten-Edit din276-C-3).', 'imported_unverified', 'In the cost framework, the total costs must be determined according to cost groups in the first level of the cost breakdown. — In the cost estimate, the total costs must be determined according to cost groups in the second level of the cost breakdown. — In the cost calculation, the total costs must be determined according to cost groups in the third level of the cost breakdown. — In the cost estimate, the total costs must be determined according to cost groups in the third level of the cost breakdown and further subdivided according to technical characteristics or manufacturing aspects. — In the cost determination, the total costs must be broken down according to cost groups up to the third level of the cost breakdown or according to the structure of the cost estimate defined for the construction project. — Costs resulting from the sum of cost groups 100 to 800 — Costs resulting from the sum of cost groups 300 and 400', 'register', '{"title":"Kostenermittlungsstufen × Kostengruppen","subtitle":"§4.3.2–4.3.7 — je Stufe eine Zeile mit KG 100–800, Σ (§3.11), Bauwerkskosten (§3.12), Eigenleistungen / Prognosekosten / Risikokosten","add_label":"+ Stufe","placement":"section","columns":[{"key":"stufe","label":"Stufe","type":"enum","options":["kr","ksch","kber","ka","kf"],"option_labels":{"kr":"Kostenrahmen (§4.3.2)","ksch":"Kostenschätzung (§4.3.3)","kber":"Kostenberechnung (§4.3.4)","ka":"Kostenanschlag (§4.3.5)","kf":"Kostenfeststellung (§4.3.7)"},"required":true,"discriminator":true},{"key":"datum","label":"Kostenstand (Datum)","type":"date","required":true},{"key":"kg100","label":"KG 100","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg200","label":"KG 200","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg300","label":"KG 300","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg400","label":"KG 400","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg500","label":"KG 500","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg600","label":"KG 600","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg700","label":"KG 700","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"kg800","label":"KG 800","type":"number","unit":"EUR","required":true,"min":0},{"key":"gesamt","label":"Σ KG 100–800","type":"derived","expr":"kg100 + kg200 + kg300 + kg400 + kg500 + kg600 + kg700 + kg800"},{"key":"bauwerk","label":"Bauwerkskosten (300+400)","type":"derived","expr":"kg300 + kg400"},{"key":"eigenleistung_eur","label":"Eigenleistungen","type":"number","unit":"EUR","min":0},{"key":"prognose_eur","label":"Prognosekosten","type":"number","unit":"EUR","min":0},{"key":"risiko_eur","label":"Risikokosten","type":"number","unit":"EUR","min":0},{"key":"bemerkung","label":"Bemerkung","type":"text"}],"footer":["KR_gesamt_calc","KSch_gesamt_calc","KBer_gesamt_calc","KA_gesamt_calc","KF_gesamt_calc","stufen_count","stufe_aktuell_gesamt","stufe_vorher_gesamt","stufen_abweichung","stufen_abweichung_pct","bauwerk_aktuell"],"note":"Cost calculations must be based on the cost status at the time of the calculation. This cost status must be documented by specifying the date. The total costs must be recorded and documented in full. If parts of the total costs cannot be recorded or documented, this must be indicated and labelled at the relevant point. Alle acht KG-Spalten sind je Zeile auszufüllen (0, wenn keine Kosten); „aktuell“ / „vorher“ sind die letzten beiden vollständigen Zeilen in Eingabereihenfolge (last_rows — kein Datumssort, din276-F-1). Die Einzelwerte KR_KG_100 … KF_gesamt der Arbeitsblätter DIN-276-18 … -22 bleiben bis din276-D-1 / X-2."}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
